      "Welcome to EC Star Nails & Spa!",
      "A Full-Service Experience Designed to Make You Shine.",
      "At EC Star Nails & Spa, our goal is to make you shine like a star. We create flattering, contemporary looks for our guests, specializing in versatile styles for everyday life. Whether you're seeking something fashion-forward, timeless, or a special look for an important event, EC Star Nails & Spa has your answer.",
      "We believe that you are your best accessory. This is why we offer a full-service experience, including luxurious manicure and pedicure services, professional waxing, and more, to help you look and feel your absolute best!",
